Package: FLBacktest
Type: Package
Title: Backtest Management Strategy Evaluation for FLR
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-15
Authors@R: 
    person("Laurence", "Kell",
           email = "laurie@kell.es",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Conducts retrospective (backtest) Management Strategy Evaluation
    for fisheries managed under harvest control rules. Provides S4 generic
    methods for closed-loop HCR feedback, short-cut and full observation
    models, retrospective bias, SAM indices, and reusable conditioning
    helpers (HCR parameters, Lorenzén M, recruitment deviations, OM
    uncertainty) for use by applications.
